{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1000_027say", "source_sha256": "28aaf389c41afd7af8171f298de4a82cd5ffafc6f046419905e307fe5a2569ba", "ja": "軽井沢です！　情報番組なんですけど、春休みやGWの\nお出かけにオススメの場所を紹介するって聞いてます。", "zh": "是轻井泽！听说是档信息节目，要介绍适合春假和黄金周出游的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "381ec088d68238d0e72c3bbc2bc5fe7d7cfdcb8b7603c687e706fccacd6c04ff", "ja": "有名な観光地だけど、緑がいっぱいで\n素敵なところだよって、{$P$}が。", "zh": "虽然是有名的旅游胜地，但绿意盎然，是个很棒的地方，{$P$}是这么说的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "341fa9ba11dfdae1bff9a359f4f9413ec3e48357086cc05a11085b1a9ef7c41e", "ja": "軽井沢かぁ、いいところだね。\n今日はお天気も良くて、お散歩日和だし……。", "zh": "轻井泽啊，真是个好地方。今天的天气也很好，正适合散步呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2e3338705aef482745d4e53c4af9b28067bd3329d5ea054aaccde2397ecde187", "ja": "軽井沢……ソフトクリームやジェラートが\n美味しいって、有名だよね。いいなぁ……♪", "zh": "轻井泽……据说那里的冰激凌和意式冰淇淋都很好吃，很有名呢。真好啊……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "967eaff5601bc077bab6e5ff68ccb5243d16582816f7288830fe79b322fabd47", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}からメール……\nえっ、もう駐車場にいる！？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}发来邮件……\n诶，已经在停车场了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "d0e184a0db8d743d26b38ceb5952227025aee956b6238356c9e0714e87b9b579", "ja": "すれ違っちゃったみたい！　風花さん、雪歩ちゃん、\nすみません！　行ってきます！", "zh": "好像错过了！风花姐、雪步，抱歉！我先走了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2351b352dbebef9e294a68707af29e15d1300ed56ab8a3a368f8ad3db944c1a0", "ja": "ううん、気をつけていってきてね。", "zh": "没事的，路上小心哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8c9ab0a8db0d662efe4eb6bdd42cb3290484d97fe5afd0e769af107f670698b3", "ja": "ロケ、がんばってね……！", "zh": "外景拍摄，加油哦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "a6d8c99e7cb78e6115004bd254671697128e5ffb22b336b6e1b502078a01c849", "ja": "はい、がんばってきます！\nあっ、お土産買ってきますね！", "zh": "好的，我会加油的！\n啊，我会买伴手礼回来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ce1e949e783838a7a87ad332bb0a27b395b6228b299c9769e2c9a7afc9144d0b", "ja": "（今日の紗代子の仕事は、情報番組のロケ。紗代子が\nCMをしている学習塾が、番組のスポンサーでもある）", "zh": "（今天纱代子的工作是参加资讯节目的外景拍摄。纱代子代言的补习班也是节目的赞助商）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1011_p", "source_sha256": "fe359b00ccfadd7bbd9a68426fb4936e002c84b70712b8135e555aa126f8f747", "ja": "（リポーター仕事も、もう何度か経験しているから、\n危なげなくこなせているな……）", "zh": "（毕竟记者的工作也已经做过好几次了，她干得很稳，一点也不慌……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "b4905747aaf2ed6b025103bd49f765b0fd9bdd8af77f72e1dd5f236c77428563", "ja": "はい！　というわけで、以上、\n地元の方オススメのジェラート屋さんでした！", "zh": "好的！那么以上就是当地人推荐的冰淇淋店！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "c31a863b16dba011e43300338b1e5e3eb611c87c254ed1bdab396809ba5f3277", "ja": "次は、どんなお店が待っているんでしょう。\nさっそくいってみたいと思います！", "zh": "接下来，会有什么样的店在等着我们呢？\n现在就马上去看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1014_director", "source_sha256": "c7dfb3d4e82c76ef8a54adbdf38fa22fba1f53ac4ab99c91802b513d445dd708", "ja": "カット！　……はい、オッケーです！\n高山さん、バッチリでしたよ！", "zh": "卡！……好，没问题！\n高山小姐，表现得非常棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1015_director", "source_sha256": "42951cabee3f482363e4a8ddbfc966ff5c9d5bcb4b82c1b1c29fdbbcbe7cdccb", "ja": "この後は、いったん休憩になります。\n20分後に再開予定ですので、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "接下来先休息一下。\n预计20分钟后重新开始，还请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "6e95444ea12c840c4cacb86ad07ced00400cdd1ef34351a7ef0c36778b7cfa55", "ja": "よろしくお願いします！\n……ふぅ。", "zh": "拜托大家了！\n……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1017_p", "source_sha256": "6ea235c8620ceda26ff421e4711d06390fbb2b5018bacf7a152e584377822977", "ja": "お疲れさま、紗代子。はい、お茶。\nたくさん歩いて喋ったから疲れただろう？", "zh": "辛苦了，纱代子。来，喝茶。\n走了那么多路又说了那么多话，累了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "2e732c54f7d5c7f379c9464f069d3ff9fa177d71f1337b84ff8c03ffa4f878ee", "ja": "大丈夫です、ありがとうございます！\n……あれ？", "zh": "我没事的，谢谢您！\n……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1019_p", "source_sha256": "9c98af1108aae987de649551034900f45ac6169d10ef6ea99ab9c501392b39a1", "ja": "どうかしたのか？", "zh": "怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "70f5c84c324ccefe53d69a173e27fe27cea52693b4c7f69fbe825c004c2038e7", "ja": "いえ。あそこにいる女の子たち、\nなんだかこっちを見てるなって……。", "zh": "没事。只是觉得那边的那群女孩子，\n好像总在往这边看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1021_p", "source_sha256": "522a45079d645e8ba9dbd453f801b393833f09aa42db2b515b11f893993780e7", "ja": "本当だ。制服だから、地元の学生さんかな。\n……あ、こっちに来た。", "zh": "真的。她们穿着制服，应该是当地的学生吧。\n……啊，她们过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1022_jimotokokosei1", "source_sha256": "6ec681fcb56d11376d9a4d9125e4f0cb55d69575dea3b3a702777f6f7938f669", "ja": "あ、あの！　紗代子ちゃん……アイドルの、\n高山紗代子ちゃんですよね！？　えっ、本物！？", "zh": "啊、那个！你是纱代子……偶像高山纱代子吧！？诶，是真的本人！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1023_027say", "source_sha256": "6e0c31d4312bfbd1d6af1dd79901ef1ff946fe4f9636c63c5bc6f197c9dd33e9", "ja": "はい、高山紗代子です！　本物ですよ！", "zh": "没错，我就是高山纱代子！货真价实哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1024_027say", "source_sha256": "389613f9d00ddece75a9ecddaa9c8888fa6d61d14561adb167d012c912f995ee", "ja": "私のこと、ご存知なんですね！\nうれしいなぁ……♪", "zh": "您知道我呀！\n好开心……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1025_jimotokokosei2", "source_sha256": "afc1b7d3f7288dc6fb54074c8dd785bed9608ce8830aa7c7a2a81c11705e4a89", "ja": "この声、ほ、本物……！\n本物の紗代子ちゃんが、わ、私の目の前に……！", "zh": "这声音，真、真的是本人……！\n真正的纱代子，就、就在我眼前……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1026_jimotokokosei1", "source_sha256": "9a33c9070ef7cf3ed0b2b90a18d767d8eeb7b5f072e1157f17bf9a7fe205d353", "ja": "この子、紗代子ちゃんのファンなんです！\n今度の劇場のライブ、行くんだよね！？", "zh": "这孩子可是紗代子的粉丝！\n下次剧场的演出，你会去的吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1027_jimotokokosei2", "source_sha256": "3d6a4c30e24b0f36e048755fe860b062b2190999f1b0987e4fc0daf2c3f794bb", "ja": "う、うん！　今度の定期公演、紗代子ちゃんが\nセンターだって聞いたから、チケット取ったんです！", "zh": "嗯、嗯！听说下次的定期公演是由纱代子当\nC位，所以我去买了票！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1028_027say", "source_sha256": "4a43c42e541a8858f6ed01324104e3f70698dbfd9c198733d5a4ee70a1293bf5", "ja": "わぁっ、劇場に！？\nありがとうございます！", "zh": "哇，要来剧场吗！？  \n谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1029_jimotokokosei2", "source_sha256": "21e6c2178560a7e87c2e68b150c226a45b9423a488b34bc678edb57de8e5de01", "ja": "絶対行きます！！　本当は12月の紗代子ちゃんの\nバースデーライブも行きたかったけど、行けなくて……", "zh": "我一定会去！！其实本来还想去参加12月纱代子的生日演唱会，可是没能去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1030_jimotokokosei2", "source_sha256": "9df75105d9817cbb0505963a91b8bba1f1b35edc65af02052e40c57b2a887ed8", "ja": "推しのバースデーを祝えなくて、凹んだから……\n次のライブは絶対行きます！", "zh": "没能给喜欢的偶像庆祝生日，心情很低落……  \n下次演唱会我一定会去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1031_027say", "source_sha256": "1f65a5a7424de3e89d2cdd9799ff7ec21f51b125f383140bae6e09073ecb3561", "ja": "そうだったんだ……\nありがとう、待ってるね！", "zh": "原来是这样啊……\n谢谢，我等着你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1032_jimotokokosei1", "source_sha256": "3b937fe6e3181c72a14316be77873ff32e46c3bdad789ccaabf412ce10caa013", "ja": "ねえ、せっかく会えたんだから、\n握手してもらいなよ！", "zh": "喂，好不容易见到了，就让对方跟你握个手嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1033_jimotokokosei2", "source_sha256": "c954ebd950dbe97d0d8ec1c024c45173b8482454915342846f97f34fbba448b3", "ja": "う、うん……あの、いいですか？", "zh": "嗯、嗯……那个，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1034_027say", "source_sha256": "908742f7d72f845eb4d9b608f2bdee229412b127a6afae6bba80bb7186d5cc53", "ja": "はい、もちろんです！　今日は、声をかけてくれて\nありがとうございました！　とっても嬉しかったです！", "zh": "嗯，当然可以！今天谢谢你主动来找我聊天！我真的特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1035_p", "source_sha256": "5d17ef96829c89dd1aa19ef7769d0d850399bf64e0f1712f3d31738f5242caf7", "ja": "お疲れさま、紗代子。今日は紗代子が頑張ってくれた\nお陰で、予定よりずいぶん早く終わったな。", "zh": "辛苦了，纱代子。多亏你今天努力了，才比计划提前了很多结束。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1036_p", "source_sha256": "067e113ce2be053bb4079879082580cccc2f743c46e07c4dd5535c2a247c139e", "ja": "ファンの子とも、予想外の交流ができたし……。", "zh": "还和粉丝们有了意想不到的交流……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1037_027say", "source_sha256": "7754170f768933563f3396c8af7aa5d68480ba1b9995999716704baddd6689ac", "ja": "はい！　まさか、ロケ先であんなふうに声を\n掛けてもらえるなんて、思ってもみませんでした。", "zh": "是的！没想到竟然会在外景拍摄地以那样的方式被搭话，我之前完全没想过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1038_027say", "source_sha256": "b14558a98c2ba46964507933d3fe5e8ca774e8dede29c579ce0e4cf59715f639", "ja": "私の知らないところで、私のことを知って、\n応援してくれている人がいるんだって……。", "zh": "在我不知道的地方，竟然有人了解我、支持着我……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1039_p", "source_sha256": "21407f1fac50c3c0ea76a163912d6477abd659dece2de8e4e1746f6f7c432a0d", "ja": "そうだな。あのファンの子は、この場所から\n紗代子を観るために、足を運んでくれるんだ。", "zh": "是啊。那位粉丝会特意来到这里，\n为了从这个地方看紗代子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1040_027say", "source_sha256": "735bdc214a7ccfd4b7484f6eb951c5fce476b949ec7f031a021ad33924c6eb51", "ja": "この場所から……私を観るために……。", "zh": "为了从这个地方……看着我……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1041_027say", "source_sha256": "7b481bc83382b92cdd9f765fb56a1b80556645a33455bedc33eda376f6b66be5", "ja": "……そういうの、ちゃんとわかってるつもり\nだったんですけど。改めて、実感した気がします。", "zh": "……这种事，我本以为自己已经明白了。\n但现在，似乎又切身体会了一遍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1042_p", "source_sha256": "8402af01cb66237680d1497fd117da0e565e727f2691b0554a4805b4dfb0a602", "ja": "うん。それだけ、アイドル高山紗代子を\n好きでいてくれる人が、増えたという事だな。", "zh": "嗯。这就说明，喜欢作为偶像的高山纱代子\n的人，已经越来越多了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1043_027say", "source_sha256": "2221d5e0b029c52a1286f49aa99ccfaadcea724fba170e272690378829790f84", "ja": "そう、なんですね。\n……。", "zh": "是这样啊。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1044_p", "source_sha256": "db10437705b77d5bd8065550608fe1d390d1fe65a664038c6886bef6942f1ee3", "ja": "何か、気になる事でもあるのか？", "zh": "是有什么在意的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1045_027say", "source_sha256": "0b3cb38d96fa0cdeeb7cd0e757beb491c6b4555c76e4681f8acf9d932c21694f", "ja": "あ、えっと……。", "zh": "啊，那个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1046_staff", "source_sha256": "4f49809d9d0cd6186d6a360012f500ebea0ef1e913818ac1d6978807cd836b37", "ja": "そろそろ撮影再開しまーす！", "zh": "差不多要重新开始拍摄啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1047_027say", "source_sha256": "065d7fb2f592eccc82dfe2a8e3349344e72efb5899758c099a613773c3b6a92e", "ja": "あ、はーい！\nすみません、{$P$}。また後で！", "zh": "啊，好——！\n抱歉，{$P$}。待会儿见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_129_1048_p", "source_sha256": "52026b88a0f86b28585acb4c4c497148ce22bc860b16b312b278993881c5fc9e", "ja": "ああ、頑張れよ！", "zh": "去吧，加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
